---

<Layout 
  title="KB Naneymi AUTIS | Kelompok Bermain Anak Autis - YP2SK" 
  description="KB Naneymi AUTIS menyediakan stimulasi tumbuh kembang usia dini bagi anak-anak dengan autisme melalui kelas khusus berkuota kecil, terapis pendamping, dan kurikulum adaptif."
  schema={kbNaneymiAutisSchema}
>
  <div class="pt-20">
    <!-- Hero Section -->
    <section class="relative h-[65vh] min-h-[500px] flex items-center justify-center overflow-hidden">
      <div class="absolute inset-0 z-0">
        <div 
          class="w-full h-full bg-cover bg-center" 
          style="background-image: linear-gradient(rgba(0, 32, 69, 0.8), rgba(0, 32, 69, 0.65)), url('/images/kb_naneymi_autis.png');"
          role="img"
          aria-label="Clean, structured special needs classroom at KB Naneymi AUTIS"
        ></div>
      </div>
      <div class="relative z-10 text-center text-on-primary px-margin-mobile md:px-margin-desktop">
        <span class="inline-block px-4 py-1.5 bg-secondary text-on-secondary rounded-full font-label-lg text-label-lg mb-sm uppercase tracking-widest shadow-sm">Kelompok Bermain Khusus Autisme</span>
        <h1 class="font-headline-xl text-headline-xl-mobile md:text-headline-xl max-w-[56rem] mx-auto mb-md text-white leading-tight">KB Naneymi AUTIS</h1>
        <p class="font-body-lg text-body-lg max-w-[42rem] mx-auto text-on-primary/90 leading-relaxed mb-lg">
          Mendampingi anak autisme usia prasekolah untuk belajar berkomunikasi, bersosialisasi, dan mandiri dengan pendekatan individual yang terstruktur dan bersahabat.
        </p>
        <div class="flex flex-col sm:flex-row items-center justify-center gap-4">
          <a href="/kontak" class="w-full sm:w-auto text-center bg-secondary text-on-secondary px-8 py-3.5 rounded-lg font-label-lg font-bold hover:brightness-110 active:scale-95 transition-all shadow-md">
            Daftar Sekarang
          </a>
          <a href="#kurikulum-adaptif" class="w-full sm:w-auto text-center border-2 border-white/30 text-white px-8 py-3.5 rounded-lg font-label-lg font-bold hover:bg-white/10 transition-all">
            Pelajari Metode
          </a>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <!-- Overview Section & Stats -->
    <section class="py-xl px-margin-mobile md:px-margin-desktop max-w-[1140px] mx-auto reveal-element">
      <div class="grid md:grid-cols-2 gap-xl items-center">
        <div class="space-y-md">
          <span class="text-secondary font-label-lg uppercase tracking-wider block font-bold">Tentang KB Naneymi AUTIS</span>
          <h2 class="font-headline-lg text-headline-lg text-primary">Lingkungan Belajar yang Terstruktur dan Aman</h2>
          <p class="text-on-surface-variant font-body-md leading-relaxed">
            KB Naneymi AUTIS didirikan untuk memberikan ruang pendidikan usia dini (2-4 tahun) yang ramah bagi anak-anak penyandang spektrum autisme. Anak-anak dengan autisme memerlukan lingkungan belajar yang sangat terstruktur, dengan petunjuk visual yang jelas, dan rasio guru pendamping yang tinggi untuk meminimalisasi kecemasan sensori mereka.
          </p>
          <p class="text-on-surface-variant font-body-md leading-relaxed">
            Kurikulum kami dirancang secara individual (Individualized Education Program / IEP) berlandaskan metode ABA dan pendekatan sensori integrasi kelompok kecil. Hal ini melatih mereka untuk mulai bersosialisasi secara perlahan dengan teman sebaya dalam suasana yang terkendali.
          </p>
          
          <!-- Key Specs Grid -->
          <div class="grid grid-cols-2 gap-sm pt-4 border-t border-outline-variant/30">
            <div class="flex items-center gap-3">
              <span class="material-symbols-outlined text-secondary text-3xl shrink-0">groups</span>
              <div>
                <p class="text-[12px] text-on-surface-variant font-bold uppercase m-0 leading-none">Rasio Guru &amp; Anak</p>
                <p class="font-headline-md text-primary m-0">1 : 2</p>
              </div>
            </div>
            <div class="flex items-center gap-3">
              <span class="material-symbols-outlined text-secondary text-3xl shrink-0">clinical_notes</span>
              <div>
                <p class="text-[12px] text-on-surface-variant font-bold uppercase m-0 leading-none">Kurikulum</p>
                <p class="font-headline-md text-primary m-0">IEP Adaptif</p>
              </div>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>
        <div class="relative group">
          <div class="absolute -top-4 -right-4 w-full h-full border-2 border-secondary rounded-xl z-0"></div>
          <div class="relative z-10 overflow-hidden rounded-xl shadow-lg aspect-[4/3] bg-surface-container-low">
            <img 
              class="w-full h-full object-cover transform group-hover:scale-105 transition-transform duration-700" 
              alt="Cozy special needs classroom at KB Naneymi AUTIS" 
              src="/images/kb_naneymi_autis.png"
            />
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <!-- Adaptative Curriculum Section -->
    <section id="kurikulum-adaptif" class="py-xl bg-surface-container-low scroll-mt-24">
      <div class="max-w-[1140px] mx-auto px-margin-mobile md:px-margin-desktop">
        <div class="text-center mb-xl reveal-element">
          <span class="text-secondary font-label-lg uppercase tracking-wider block font-bold mb-xs">Metode Pembelajaran</span>
          <h2 class="font-headline-lg text-headline-lg text-primary">Pilar Kurikulum KB Autis</h2>
          <div class="w-16 h-1 bg-secondary mx-auto rounded-full mt-sm"></div>
        </div>

        <div class="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-4 gap-gutter">
          <!-- Stimulasi Sensori Kelompok -->
          <div class="bg-white p-lg rounded-xl shadow-sm border border-outline-variant/10 hover:shadow-md transition-all duration-300 reveal-element">
            <div class="w-12 h-12 bg-secondary-container flex items-center justify-center rounded-lg mb-md text-secondary">
              <span class="material-symbols-outlined text-3xl">toys_fan</span>
            </div>
            <h3 class="font-headline-md text-headline-md text-primary mb-xs">Sensory Play</h3>
            <p class="text-on-surface-variant text-sm leading-relaxed">
              Mengenalkan berbagai tekstur (pasir, air, busa, biji-bijian) dalam kelompok kecil untuk melatih regulasi sensori anak.
            </p>
          </div>

          <!-- Komunikasi Alternatif (PECS) -->
          <div class="bg-white p-lg rounded-xl shadow-sm border border-outline-variant/10 hover:shadow-md transition-all duration-300 reveal-element">
            <div class="w-12 h-12 bg-secondary-container flex items-center justify-center rounded-lg mb-md text-secondary">
              <span class="material-symbols-outlined text-3xl">image</span>
            </div>
            <h3 class="font-headline-md text-headline-md text-primary mb-xs">Visual &amp; PECS</h3>
            <p class="text-on-surface-variant text-sm leading-relaxed">
              Menggunakan kartu komunikasi gambar (*Picture Exchange Communication System*) dan jadwal visual terstruktur untuk mempermudah anak mengekspresikan keinginan.
            </p>
          </div>

          <!-- Kemandirian Harian (ADL) -->
          <div class="bg-white p-lg rounded-xl shadow-sm border border-outline-variant/10 hover:shadow-md transition-all duration-300 reveal-element">
            <div class="w-12 h-12 bg-secondary-container flex items-center justify-center rounded-lg mb-md text-secondary">
              <span class="material-symbols-outlined text-3xl">wash</span>
            </div>
            <h3 class="font-headline-md text-headline-md text-primary mb-xs">Kemandirian Harian</h3>
            <p class="text-on-surface-variant text-sm leading-relaxed">
              Melatih kemampuan dasar toilet training secara intensif, mencuci tangan, merapikan cangkir/piring setelah makan, dan memakai kaos kaki mandiri.
            </p>
          </div>

          <!-- Keterampilan Bersosialisasi -->
          <div class="bg-white p-lg rounded-xl shadow-sm border border-outline-variant/10 hover:shadow-md transition-all duration-300 reveal-element">
            <div class="w-12 h-12 bg-secondary-container flex items-center justify-center rounded-lg mb-md text-secondary">
              <span class="material-symbols-outlined text-3xl">group_work</span>
            </div>
            <h3 class="font-headline-md text-headline-md text-primary mb-xs">Sosialisasi Terpadu</h3>
            <p class="text-on-surface-variant text-sm leading-relaxed">
              Melatih anak bersabar bergantian mainan, duduk dalam lingkaran bersama (circle time), serta melakukan kontak mata awal dengan guru dan teman.
            </p>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <!-- FAQ Section -->
    <section class="py-xl bg-white reveal-element">
      <div class="max-w-[800px] mx-auto px-margin-mobile">
        <div class="text-center mb-xl">
          <span class="text-secondary font-label-lg uppercase tracking-wider block font-bold mb-xs">Tanya Jawab</span>
          <h2 class="font-headline-lg text-headline-lg text-primary">Pertanyaan Seputar KB Autis</h2>
          <div class="w-16 h-1 bg-secondary mx-auto rounded-full mt-sm"></div>
        </div>

        <div class="space-y-4">
          <!-- FAQ 1 -->
          <div class="faq-item border border-outline-variant/35 rounded-xl bg-white overflow-hidden transition-all duration-300">
            <button class="faq-toggle w-full p-md md:p-lg flex items-center justify-between text-left font-bold text-primary hover:bg-surface transition-colors cursor-pointer">
              <span>Berapa kapasitas murid per kelas di KB Naneymi AUTIS?</span>
              <span class="material-symbols-outlined transition-transform duration-300 faq-icon">expand_more</span>
            </button>
            <div class="faq-answer hidden px-md md:px-lg pb-md md:pb-lg text-on-surface-variant text-sm leading-relaxed border-t border-outline-variant/20 pt-sm">
              Untuk menjaga kenyamanan sensori anak dan efektivitas pengajaran, satu kelas dibatasi maksimal hanya berisi 4-6 anak dengan didampingi oleh 2 orang guru/terapis profesional secara terus-menerus.
            </div>
          </div>

          <!-- FAQ 2 -->
          <div class="faq-item border border-outline-variant/35 rounded-xl bg-white overflow-hidden transition-all duration-300">
            <button class="faq-toggle w-full p-md md:p-lg flex items-center justify-between text-left font-bold text-primary hover:bg-surface transition-colors cursor-pointer">
              <span>Apakah anak harus sudah bisa bicara untuk masuk ke kelas ini?</span>
              <span class="material-symbols-outlined transition-transform duration-300 faq-icon">expand_more</span>
            </button>
            <div class="faq-answer hidden px-md md:px-lg pb-md md:pb-lg text-on-surface-variant text-sm leading-relaxed border-t border-outline-variant/20 pt-sm">
              Tidak harus. Kami menyambut anak-anak non-verbal. Di kelas ini, anak akan dilatih menggunakan metode komunikasi alternatif seperti PECS (Picture Exchange Communication System) dan bahasa isyarat fungsional sambil tetap dirangsang secara verbal oleh terapis wicara.
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <!-- Final CTA Section -->
    <section class="py-xl bg-primary relative overflow-hidden">
      <div class="absolute inset-0 opacity-10">
        <div class="w-full h-full bg-[radial-gradient(circle_at_center,_var(--tw-gradient-stops))] from-secondary-fixed via-transparent to-transparent animate-pulse"></div>
      </div>
      <div class="relative z-10 max-w-[800px] mx-auto text-center px-margin-mobile text-on-primary">
        <h2 class="font-headline-lg text-headline-lg-mobile md:text-headline-lg mb-md text-white">Mulai Intervensi Dini Terbaik untuk Buah Hati Anda</h2>
        <p class="font-body-md mb-xl opacity-90 leading-relaxed max-w-[36rem] mx-auto">
          Daftarkan anak Anda pada program KB Naneymi AUTIS. Hubungi kami untuk kunjungan kelas (visiting kelas) dan berkonsultasi mengenai program adaptif kami.
        </p>
        <div class="flex flex-col sm:flex-row items-center justify-center gap-md">
          <a 
            href="/kontak" 
            class="w-full sm:w-auto text-center bg-secondary text-on-secondary px-8 py-3.5 rounded-lg font-label-lg font-bold hover:brightness-115 hover:scale-105 active:scale-95 transition-all shadow-lg"
          >
            Hubungi Panitia PMB
          </a>
          <a 
            href="/kontak" 
            class="w-full sm:w-auto text-center border border-white/30 text-white px-8 py-3.5 rounded-lg font-label-lg font-bold hover:bg-white/10 hover:scale-105 active:scale-95 transition-all"
          >
            Trial Kelas &amp; Konsultasi
          </a>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>
  </div>
</Layout>

<script>
  function setupPage() {
    // FAQ Toggle
    const toggles = document.querySelectorAll('.faq-toggle');
    toggles.forEach(toggle => {
      toggle.addEventListener('click', () => {
        const item = toggle.parentElement;
        const answer = item?.querySelector('.faq-answer');
        const icon = toggle.querySelector('.faq-icon');
        
        const isHidden = answer?.classList.contains('hidden');
        
        // Close other items
        document.querySelectorAll('.faq-answer').forEach(ans => ans.classList.add('hidden'));
        document.querySelectorAll('.faq-icon').forEach(ic => ic.classList.remove('rotate-180'));
        document.querySelectorAll('.faq-item').forEach(it => it.classList.remove('border-secondary'));

        if (isHidden) {
          answer?.classList.remove('hidden');
          icon?.classList.add('rotate-180');
          item?.classList.add('border-secondary');
        }
      });
    });

    // Reveal animations on scroll
    const observerOptions = {
      threshold: 0.1,
      rootMargin: "0px 0px -50px 0px"
    };

    const observer = new IntersectionObserver((entries) => {
      entries.forEach(entry => {
        if (entry.isIntersecting) {
          entry.target.classList.add('opacity-100', 'translate-y-0');
          entry.target.classList.remove('opacity-0', 'translate-y-10');
          observer.unobserve(entry.target);
        }
      });
    }, observerOptions);

    const elements = document.querySelectorAll('.reveal-element');
    elements.forEach(el => {
      el.classList.add('transition-all', 'duration-700', 'ease-out', 'opacity-0', 'translate-y-10');
      observer.observe(el);
    });
  }

  // Setup on load and page transition
  setupPage();
  document.addEventListener('astro:after-swap', setupPage);
</script>
